# libSceWebBrowserDialog - added for #101 (a provider's own web UI in the
# system browser), which stage 6 removed.
#
# No SDK stub .so exists for it. Names from SharpProspero
# Interop/Dialog/WebBrowserDialog.cs, the console-tested binding.
#
# Nothing opens the browser any more, but the module stays NEEDED with the six
# imports the stage 5 build booted with on 12.70: src/evo_prx_keep.c calls each
# one, in code that never runs. Without those calls the module would be NEEDED
# with no imports at all, which the console has never loaded, and a module the
# loader rejects leaves no log (CE-108255-1). Every name here must stay
# referenced there, or package-app.sh's dead-import check stops the build. If a
# build does not start at all, suspect this file first.
sceWebBrowserDialogInitialize
sceWebBrowserDialogOpen
sceWebBrowserDialogUpdateStatus
sceWebBrowserDialogGetResult
sceWebBrowserDialogClose
sceWebBrowserDialogTerminate
